Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:59.92,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:49.92,0:01:54.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.63,0:01:54.93,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you find him?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.93,0:01:58.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here he is! We found Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.02,0:02:01.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! They found him?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.33,0:02:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.23,0:02:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.13,0:02:07.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is that, anyway?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.23,0:02:13.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is terrible...Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.02,0:02:17.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no heartbeat.Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.33,0:02:25.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In order for you to get a healthy smile back,Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.00,0:02:28.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I prepared an exceptionally nutritious dish.Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sanji-kun.Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.73,0:02:35.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Despite what your body endured, you're still so gorgeous that it hurts.Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.55,0:02:39.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good grief. Who said you could use my kitchen without asking?Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.47,0:02:41.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Madam, that roast over there is yours.Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.95,0:02:43.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's high in protein and will rejuvena–Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.98,0:02:46.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not a "madam."Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.47,0:02:50.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I may be single, but I'm still beaming with beauty.Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.19,0:02:52.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're only 139 years old, right?Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine! Help me!Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.15,0:02:58.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hey! Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.42,0:03:00.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.12,0:03:03.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.87,0:03:05.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.44,0:03:09.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This guy's gonna join us and become our friend!Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.08,0:03:11.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.02,0:03:12.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't agree to anything like that!Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.92,0:03:13.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You did.Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.55,0:03:14.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't!Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.15,0:03:14.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You did!Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.97,0:03:16.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, both of you!Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.25,0:03:19.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.32,0:03:21.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Friend, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.60,0:03:25.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a strong significance that word holds for him.Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no idea...Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.77,0:03:36.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When he was all alone, only one man was able to open his heart.Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.05,0:03:39.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His name was Dr. Hiriluk.Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.52,0:03:44.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was a quack who gave Chopper his name and cared for him as a son.Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it!Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.76,0:03:53.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is he there?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.43,0:03:55.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! We can't find him!Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.07,0:03:57.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk, that darn quack!Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.50,0:04:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll catch him at all costs! Those're King Wapol's orders!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.37,0:04:01.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.55,0:04:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.57,0:04:20.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't go on like this. Let's call a doctor.Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.24,0:04:23.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's pointless. There aren't any doctors in this country...Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.69,0:04:27.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,except for the Issie 20 who belong exclusively to Wapol.Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.10,0:04:31.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then we'll beg Wapol to let the Issie 20 come here! I'll go.Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.23,0:04:33.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.78,0:04:40.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll examine him.Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.22,0:04:43.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk! N-No thank you! Please don't!Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.85,0:04:47.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A bunch of people you treated ended up getting worse!Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.27,0:04:49.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be nervous.Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.14,0:04:53.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just developed a wonderful cure-all yesterday.Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.11,0:04:55.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're in luck.Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.10,0:05:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? It's not what you think. That's just a tranquilizer gun.Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for patients in extreme pain.Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.27,0:05:06.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I'm gonna go get the guards!Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.37,0:05:11.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please leave! If it's money you want, I'll pay!Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.41,0:05:17.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't take money from sick people. I just want to help you.Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.18,0:05:21.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't! Stop it! I've got a family!Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.01,0:05:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Croak! Ribbit! Croak! Ribbit!Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.72,0:05:28.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Croak! Croak!Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.98,0:05:32.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? This is strange. Did I use the wrong ingredient?Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.43,0:05:37.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought frog extract would work. Damn... guess it was a failure.Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.82,0:05:39.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry... I didn't mean for this to happen.Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.87,0:05:41.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk! Are you in there?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.74,0:05:44.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.57,0:05:50.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are ya happy, young man?Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.58,0:06:00.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The doctor hunt is almost over.Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.52,0:06:04.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hear that you and I are the only doctors left in this country.Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.01,0:06:08.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol is desperately trying to catch us.Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.52,0:06:11.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if he wasn't, you're an outcast around here...Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.46,0:06:15.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,seeing as you're nothing but a quack.Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.07,0:06:21.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't get caught by some doctor hunt.Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.62,0:06:25.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One day, I'll save this country using medical science.Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.01,0:06:29.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh? Didn't you mean to say "destroy this country"?Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.16,0:06:31.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are people on the bridge!Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.08,0:06:33.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll see you around, quack.Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd like to avoid that, thief.Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.26,0:06:46.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll never get caught!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.59,0:06:49.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll save as many sick people as possible!Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.78,0:06:52.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.23,0:06:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've been shot?Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.81,0:07:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to stop the bleeding right away or you'll die!Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.74,0:07:03.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll save you!Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.40,0:07:06.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a yeti! Shoot it dead!Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.78,0:07:12.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I made a new ointment just three days ago that heals broken bones.Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.45,0:07:13.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're in luck.Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.96,0:07:19.16,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get away!Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.16,0:07:20.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Take it down!Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.42,0:07:22.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Shoot it!Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.06,0:07:30.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you? You don't look like a human.Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.40,0:07:33.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, you're that yeti everyone's been talking about.Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.55,0:07:48.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We hit it!Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.38,0:07:50.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It wasn't enough! Finish it!Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.47,0:08:02.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H... How dare you...Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who do you...Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.46,0:08:08.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,think I am?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.39,0:08:17.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to shoot you!Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.79,0:08:22.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Dr. Hiriluk!Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.92,0:08:24.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.58,0:09:21.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was Chopper and Hiriluk's first encounter.Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.86,0:09:27.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what happened after Hiriluk took in a reindeer?Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.57,0:09:32.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! You can talk?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.61,0:09:39.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say anything for three days?Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.44,0:09:43.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd hate me if I talked.Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.15,0:09:47.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I talked to humans the other day, they shot me...Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.48,0:09:50.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because it's strange for a reindeer to speak.Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.28,0:09:52.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what if you can speak?Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.76,0:09:58.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can speak, too. A lot better than you can.Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.20,0:10:01.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.46,0:10:03.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.20,0:10:13.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! It failed again! Hey, are you okay, Chopper?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.14,0:10:20.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Well, you weren't okay to start with, I guess.Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.09,0:10:27.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you calling me Chopper?Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.66,0:10:30.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're Tony Tony Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.99,0:10:36.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, you're a reindeer whose first-rate antlers can chop down trees.Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.57,0:10:40.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a cool name, isn't it? That's what I'll call you.Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.57,0:10:44.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper...Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.64,0:10:52.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, Chopper. You must observe patients carefully while treating them.Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.63,0:10:56.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doing so will save people's lives.Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.80,0:11:01.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go! With every passing day, patients are depending on me!Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.81,0:11:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, quack!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.27,0:11:07.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.90,0:11:07.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.94,0:11:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.98,0:11:08.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.02,0:11:08.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.06,0:11:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 51,0:11:08.06,0:11:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.11,0:11:08.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 51,0:11:08.11,0:11:08.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.15,0:11:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 51,0:11:08.15,0:11:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.19,0:11:08.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 51,0:11:08.19,0:11:08.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.23,0:11:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 51,0:11:08.23,0:11:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.63,0:11:09.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.82,0:11:09.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.86,0:11:09.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.90,0:11:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.94,0:11:09.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.98,0:11:10.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.02,0:11:10.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 51,0:11:10.02,0:11:10.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.07,0:11:10.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 51,0:11:10.07,0:11:10.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.11,0:11:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 51,0:11:10.11,0:11:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never come back!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.15,0:11:10.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 51,0:11:10.15,0:11:10.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.19,0:11:10.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 51,0:11:10.19,0:11:10.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.23,0:11:10.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 51,0:11:10.23,0:11:10.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.27,0:11:10.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.32,0:11:10.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.36,0:11:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.40,0:11:10.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.44,0:11:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.86,0:11:11.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.90,0:11:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.94,0:11:11.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.98,0:11:12.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.03,0:11:12.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 51,0:11:12.03,0:11:12.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.07,0:11:12.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 51,0:11:12.07,0:11:12.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.11,0:11:12.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 51,0:11:12.11,0:11:12.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.15,0:11:12.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 51,0:11:12.15,0:11:12.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.19,0:11:12.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 51,0:11:12.19,0:11:12.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.23,0:11:12.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 51,0:11:12.23,0:11:12.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.28,0:11:12.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 51,0:11:12.28,0:11:12.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.32,0:11:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 51,0:11:12.32,0:11:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.36,0:11:12.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.40,0:11:12.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.44,0:11:12.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.48,0:11:14.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! It's the guards!Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.57,0:11:17.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper! We'll use the decoy plan!Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.01,0:11:17.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The what?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.78,0:11:19.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take care!Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.35,0:11:23.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.61,0:11:27.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You almost got me killed!Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.12,0:11:30.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you almost died once anyway, you blue-nosed oaf!Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.85,0:11:33.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave my blue nose out of this!Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.73,0:11:46.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.02,0:11:46.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.70,0:11:50.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is... the first time I've fought with someone.Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.64,0:11:56.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That makes sense. To fight, you need to have an opponent.Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.99,0:11:59.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then... is it your first time for this as well?Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.39,0:12:04.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.69,0:12:09.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I offer you this gift to commemorate our making up.Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.99,0:12:13.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A gift...? Making up...?Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.67,0:12:25.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Life is hard for outcasts like us, isn't it?Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.89,0:12:28.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But don't hold a grudge against humans.Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.77,0:12:31.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This country is sick right now.Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.73,0:12:34.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The king and his people suffer from a sickness of the heart.Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.85,0:12:38.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Some would probably say that you can't heal a sick country,Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.72,0:12:39.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but that's not true.Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.76,0:12:44.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once my invention is complete, this country will be saved!Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.96,0:12:49.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There used to be a master thief in a country far to the west.Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.33,0:12:52.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He had a serious heart disease.Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.71,0:12:55.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He sought treatment from every skilled doctor he could findDialogue: 50,0:12:55.94,0:12:58.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but none could fix him.Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.57,0:13:03.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Being told he would die unsettled him, but then he passed by a mountain.Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.08,0:13:07.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There... he saw a sight that he had never seen in his life.Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.99,0:13:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cherry blossoms!Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.15,0:13:20.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He saw vivid cherry blossoms all over the mountain!Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.65,0:13:24.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After that, he went to see another doctor and was shockedDialogue: 50,0:13:24.37,0:13:26.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because the doctor said,Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.10,0:13:28.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"You have a clean bill of health."Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.74,0:13:29.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.62,0:13:33.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was all better! You're thinking it must've been some miracle, right?Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.58,0:13:35.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it was definitely medical science!Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.65,0:13:39.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A powerful emotion somehow triggered a change in the man's body!Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.75,0:13:44.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That means there's no disease in this world that can't be cured.Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.89,0:13:50.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone says about me, I'll save this country as a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.47,0:13:57.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why I raised this skull and crossbones against all diseases!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.63,0:13:58.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A skull...Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.57,0:14:03.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This here... is a symbol of conviction that defies the impossible!Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.94,0:14:07.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll save this country as a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.45,0:14:12.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By raising this flag, I'll fight just like pirates do!Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.04,0:14:15.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.04,0:14:17.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Join us and become our friend!Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.59,0:14:21.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? Whoa! That looks so good!Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.02,0:14:29.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's cool to be a pirate!Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.75,0:14:32.60,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor, what are pirates?Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.23,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates?Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.87,0:14:37.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are remarkable people who roam the seas.Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.74,0:14:40.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,They have large, muscular bodies and eagle eyes.Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.38,0:14:42.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Their voices are like thunder splitting the sky!Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.55,0:14:46.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you... really a pirate?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.32,0:14:46.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.68,0:14:49.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am...Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.72,0:14:54.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like I've been saying, join us! It's fun to be a pirate! Pirates sing, too.Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.08,0:14:57.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Th-They sing?Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.96,0:15:01.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And they dance, too!Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.03,0:15:02.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You call that being a pirate?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.93,0:15:04.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep! And there are lots of adventures.Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.43,0:15:08.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Adventures? So pirates go on adventures then?Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.14,0:15:12.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course! Pirates risk their lives to go on adventures!Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can meet lots of amazing people!Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.89,0:15:17.15,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are incredible!Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.15,0:15:20.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,There are countless people like that out at sea!Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.45,0:15:24.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper, go out to sea some day.Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.29,0:15:28.69,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If you do, you'll realize just how small your own problems are.Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.69,0:15:34.04,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Compared to the rest of the world, your home island is this small!Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.04,0:15:35.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.50,0:15:39.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,No, it's smaller! Like this! It's true!Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.91,0:15:47.26,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Your future lies beyond that sea!Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.38,0:15:52.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The good times passed in the twinkling of an eye.Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.14,0:15:54.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But eventually...Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.66,0:16:05.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the time to bid farewell...Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.63,0:16:08.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,comes for everyone.Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It took a whole year,Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.45,0:16:17.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,but your treatment has finished.Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.66,0:16:20.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your injuries are completely healed, Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.63,0:16:23.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! Thank you, Doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then... take care.Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.78,0:16:27.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.09,0:16:32.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, go! Live as you please! I'm busy with my research!Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.10,0:16:37.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I no longer have any moral obligation to take care of you!Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.63,0:16:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor! I'll never cause any trouble again, so please let me back in!Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.90,0:16:47.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll give you daily shoulder massages! I'll brew tea and clean the house!Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.74,0:16:49.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please! Let me stay!Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.91,0:16:55.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have any friends! I have no place to go!Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.88,0:17:02.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor! Doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.29,0:17:08.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor! Doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.09,0:17:11.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.96,0:17:19.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, Doctor, I'm injured. Hey, Doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.14,0:17:22.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.74,0:17:27.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why... Doctor?Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.69,0:17:31.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go! Go out to sea! Go anywhere!Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.41,0:17:33.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But don't ever come back here!Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.63,0:17:51.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.98,0:18:01.44,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm... going to die soon.Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.73,0:18:05.23,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you will.Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.23,0:18:08.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me. How much longer do I have?Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.53,0:18:11.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh? If you're asking me to examine you, I refuse.Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.06,0:18:13.78,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't have the money to pay my fee.Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.20,0:18:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me!Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.87,0:18:26.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How do you plan to kill me with a tranquilizer gun?Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.71,0:18:31.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll tell you. You'll die ten days from now at five o'clock.Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.22,0:18:33.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You won't have to suffer any more.Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.12,0:18:35.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ten days... That'll be enough.Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.76,0:18:37.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I only need two days...Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.60,0:18:41.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In two days, I will complete my thirty-year-long research project.Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.16,0:18:44.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will... make cherry blossoms bloom in this country!Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.69,0:18:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cherry blossoms? So that research you've continued for thirty yearsDialogue: 50,0:18:49.63,0:18:52.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was about making cherry blossoms bloom?Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.07,0:18:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The miracle cherry blossoms that saved you, a master thief, long ago?Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.07,0:18:58.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.28,0:18:59.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.81,0:19:04.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Foolish man. This is a winter island where it's bitter cold year-round.Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cherry blossoms won't bloom here.Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.88,0:19:08.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They will!Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.21,0:19:14.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was just a thug grasping life by a thread, but my heart changed as I kept on living.Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.34,0:19:18.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every human in this world can be saved!Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.05,0:19:22.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd like to prove it here on Drum, the land where I was born!Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.22,0:19:27.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen. What you're attempting isn't medicine or anything like it.Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.71,0:19:32.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if cherry blossoms bloom, it will do nothing for human bodies.Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.24,0:19:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk!Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.35,0:19:46.62,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper... we're alike. So before I die, I'd like to teach you...Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.46,0:19:49.69,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,that nothing in this world is impossible.Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.69,0:19:52.73,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You can accomplish anything and everything!Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.73,0:20:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the story of these two doesn't have a happy ending.Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.05,0:20:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.64,0:20:05.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait, wait, wait, wait!Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.19,0:20:07.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That smell...Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.28,0:20:15.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.64,0:20:16.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.48,0:20:24.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When he found out that Hiriluk had only ten days to live,Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.38,0:20:27.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper was very upset.Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.62,0:20:30.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that was only natural.Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.28,0:20:34.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he took action in his own way...Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.39,0:20:48.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm... going to die soon.Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.34,0:20:52.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I will... make cherry blossoms bloom in this country!Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.01,0:21:01.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This here... is a symbol of conviction that defies the impossible!Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.12,0:21:08.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Many guards have been absent lately.Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.86,0:21:12.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... they're out picking mushrooms at the request of the Issie 20.Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.50,0:21:13.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mushrooms?Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.73,0:21:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They said there's some mushroom that can cure anything...Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.37,0:21:20.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mushroom?Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.72,0:21:21.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.26,0:21:21.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.34,0:21:24.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bonehead! They'll see us!Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.94,0:21:27.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor, about what they said...Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.87,0:21:49.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to shoot you!Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.08,0:21:53.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But don't ever come back here!Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.59,0:22:06.47,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I treated you terribly.Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.47,0:22:10.23,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait until you can see my cherry blossoms.Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.23,0:22:13.58,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll be my final accomplishment.Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.08,0:22:28.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... here we go again!Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.70,0:22:51.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I don't have much time left!Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.91,0:23:16.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing's impossible when a man raises a skull and crossbones flag!Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.37,0:23:18.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I told you, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.27,0:23:24.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will fight!Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.97,0:23:27.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just like pirates do!Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.46,0:23:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found it! The amiudake.Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.23,0:23:44.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the one!Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.76,0:23:46.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How do I get across?Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.32,0:24:13.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.90,0:24:25.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.90,0:24:33.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I lost... one of your precious books.Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.24,0:24:36.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What... happened to you?Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.04,0:24:38.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mushroom...Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.15,0:24:42.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Medicine...Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.25,0:24:44.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's an amiudake!Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.67,0:24:49.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You... got it for me?Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.16,0:24:52.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please live... Please live, Doctor.Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.83,0:24:57.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanna be a doctor. Please teach me how to become one.Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.54,0:25:01.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll fight, too... just like pirates do!Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.94,0:25:08.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can a reindeer become one too?Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.32,0:25:14.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can! You can! You can!Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.66,0:25:17.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can be a great doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.02,0:25:19.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doct... I can't breathe.Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.86,0:25:23.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...because you have such a kind heart.Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.84,0:25:28.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bonehead!Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.14,0:25:34.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chess! Kuromarimo!Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.80,0:25:37.52,Main-207-,,0,0,1,,Is the doctor hunt going well?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.52,0:25:38.77,Main-207-,,0,0,1,,Yes sir.Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.77,0:25:41.14,Main-207-,,0,0,1,,We've exiled most of the doctors already.Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.14,0:25:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,1,,Most?Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.23,0:25:45.46,Main-207-,,0,0,1,,However, two have eluded capture.Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.46,0:25:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That Dr. Kureha and...Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.86,0:25:50.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...the quack, Hiriluk.Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.32,0:25:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.95,0:25:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! I've come up with a good idea!Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.65,0:25:56.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Hm? – Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.91,0:26:04.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Send an official notice to the citizens. The Issie 20 have all... fallen ill.Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.70,0:26:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How is the amiudake soup? Is it good?Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.39,0:26:10.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Damn, this tastes terrible!Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.74,0:26:11.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.24,0:26:14.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No living thing could stomach this!Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.41,0:26:15.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no...Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.71,0:26:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be so down. Medicine isn't supposed to taste good.Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.35,0:26:21.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That means it's working.Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.73,0:26:24.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.43,0:26:28.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.30,0:26:29.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha...?Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.57,0:26:34.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.04,0:26:39.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.14,0:26:40.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I did it...Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.54,0:26:41.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.10,0:26:43.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I finally did it... This is it!Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.04,0:26:52.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This reaction... I've waited thirty years for this.Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.72,0:26:57.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I did it, Chopper! I've completed my research!Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.97,0:27:01.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wasn't wrong! I wasn't! I wasn't!Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.65,0:27:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I can make cherry blossoms bloom on this winter island!Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.24,0:27:24.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen. I'm going out, but you stay put and rest here.Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.55,0:27:25.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.42,0:27:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See you later!Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.69,0:27:30.88,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor was happy...Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.88,0:27:36.34,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I was able... to cure someone's sickness!Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.84,0:27:37.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.72,0:27:40.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll make a fine doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.39,0:27:42.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm living proof of that.Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.57,0:27:51.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you know that the entire country has a screw loose?Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.65,0:27:53.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.36,0:27:57.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's over the Issie 20 falling ill, right? Ridiculous!Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.88,0:28:00.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... what brought you here today?Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.75,0:28:03.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Actually, I have a favor to ask.Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.24,0:28:03.83,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't bother, I refuse.Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.83,0:28:05.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't asked anything yet!Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.79,0:28:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's this dust?Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.98,0:28:10.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That is the fruit of thirty years.Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.69,0:28:13.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a medicine I've finally completed—Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.45,0:28:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a cure-all that can mend this country's sick heart.Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.47,0:28:20.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a waste of thirty years. Well, good for you.Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.60,0:28:22.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, why are you showing it to me?Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.93,0:28:25.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There isn't enough dust, and I'm out of time.Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.84,0:28:28.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want you to make the cherry blossoms bloom.Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.44,0:28:30.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's absurd! Why do I have to–Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.60,0:28:30.69,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,And one more thing!Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.69,0:28:32.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please teach medicine to Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.90,0:28:35.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He wants to become a doctor.Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.36,0:28:36.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's enough!Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.60,0:28:39.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a reindeer and a monster,Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.07,0:28:41.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I know he'll make a fine doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.95,0:28:38.34,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would I...?Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.07,0:28:43.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a good kid with a kind heart.Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.36,0:28:46.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He risked his life to make a remedy for me!Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.29,0:28:49.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please! Help him become a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:28:49.62,0:28:51.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have some nerve!Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.40,0:28:56.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You want me to take care of your stupid research and strange pet?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.29,0:28:58.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should know I'm not someoneDialogue: 50,0:28:58.47,0:29:01.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who'll sympathize with a man just because he's about to croak!Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.55,0:29:03.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.27,0:29:12.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I know... We've known each other a long time.Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.87,0:29:16.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.15,0:29:20.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not like you, Hiriluk... throwing in the towel already.Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.91,0:29:23.37,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm out of time.Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.37,0:29:24.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That idiot! He wouldn't!Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.91,0:29:26.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.42,0:29:28.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Issie 20 fell ill!Dialogue: 50,0:29:28.15,0:29:29.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who'll treat our people now?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.66,0:29:31.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least give us access to medicine!Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.75,0:29:33.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do!Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.13,0:29:35.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even doctors get sick!Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.56,0:29:34.90,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.90,0:29:36.71,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Hiriluk?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.35,0:29:36.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Out of my way! Out of my way!Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.17,0:29:41.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard is crazy!Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.38,0:29:43.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Prepare the ropeway.Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.54,0:29:45.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take me to the castle.Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.64,0:29:48.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's Hiriluk?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.61,0:29:52.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't have to run away! I know about you!Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.19,0:29:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you where the quack went!Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.15,0:29:59.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D-Doctor got better so he went to town...Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.61,0:30:02.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got better? There's no getting better for him.Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.46,0:30:04.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Modern medicine can't help him.Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.72,0:30:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not true! Look at this!Dialogue: 50,0:30:07.59,0:30:09.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's fine now because he ate this!Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.79,0:30:12.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's... an amiudake!Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.50,0:30:15.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a cure-all! So he's fine now!Dialogue: 50,0:30:15.90,0:30:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor said that he felt better, too!Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.96,0:30:20.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's going to teach me how to be a doct–Dialogue: 50,0:30:28.68,0:30:30.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that for?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.39,0:30:34.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You stupid reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.06,0:30:36.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That mushroom is...Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.81,0:30:39.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That mushroom is...Dialogue: 50,0:30:43.62,0:30:44.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a deadly poison!Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.79,0:30:49.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once you eat it, you'll be dead within half a day!Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.26,0:30:49.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:30:52.56,0:30:55.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why that idiot...Dialogue: 50,0:30:56.27,0:31:01.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That can't be true. I looked it up in a book...Dialogue: 50,0:31:01.04,0:31:03.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,although I lost that book...Dialogue: 50,0:31:03.24,0:31:04.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That mushroom can beat diseases!Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.97,0:31:09.55,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why I raised this skull and crossbones against all diseases!Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.55,0:31:14.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! There was a skull next to the amiudake picture!Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.39,0:31:17.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor also said he got better!Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.40,0:31:20.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'll die! You're a liar!Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.53,0:31:24.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Paddle faster! Hurry up!Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.70,0:31:27.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There isn't a second to waste!Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.20,0:31:30.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What you did touched him deeply.Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.50,0:31:33.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the skull in the book indicates poison.Dialogue: 50,0:31:33.10,0:31:33.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a lie!Dialogue: 50,0:31:33.67,0:31:36.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not a lie! Remember this:Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.37,0:31:39.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one medicine in this world can possibly cure every disease.Dialogue: 50,0:31:39.78,0:31:41.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why doctors exist!Dialogue: 50,0:31:41.78,0:31:42.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not true!Dialogue: 50,0:31:42.71,0:31:46.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen. You can't save people just by being kind!Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.26,0:31:50.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want to save them, learn medical knowledge and skills!Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.79,0:31:53.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Without these skills, you can't save anyone!Dialogue: 50,0:32:03.64,0:32:04.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot.Dialogue: 50,0:32:16.25,0:32:18.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol! Hiriluk is heading to this castle!Dialogue: 50,0:32:18.95,0:32:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So he took the bait!Dialogue: 50,0:32:21.19,0:32:23.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a hippo!Dialogue: 50,0:32:23.13,0:32:27.09,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Is he serious? Why? What for?Dialogue: 50,0:32:28.43,0:32:30.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not returning to this house.Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.86,0:32:34.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gone to make the castle his graveyard.Dialogue: 50,0:32:36.33,0:32:40.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take me to the patients! I came to save the Issie 20!Dialogue: 50,0:32:43.64,0:32:44.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.98,0:32:49.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a hippo! You still don't get it?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.35,0:32:54.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was a trap! As you can see, the Issie 20 are just fine!Dialogue: 50,0:32:56.45,0:33:00.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your only purpose here is to die, Dr. Hiriluk.Dialogue: 50,0:33:01.33,0:33:03.17,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did he come here?Dialogue: 50,0:33:06.34,0:33:07.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guards, ready...Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.14,0:33:14.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all it was?Dialogue: 50,0:33:16.04,0:33:19.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good... So none of them are sick?Dialogue: 50,0:33:22.18,0:33:26.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was convinced that this was a national crisis.Dialogue: 50,0:33:26.22,0:33:29.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it was merely a trick...Dialogue: 50,0:33:30.66,0:33:35.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmph! If it really was a crisis, I wouldn't want someone like you!Dialogue: 50,0:33:35.36,0:33:37.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I digress. Execute him!Dialogue: 50,0:33:37.50,0:33:42.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't bother. You can't kill me.Dialogue: 50,0:33:42.58,0:33:43.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:33:44.20,0:33:48.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... when do you think a person dies?Dialogue: 50,0:33:51.68,0:33:54.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When a pistol's bullet pierces their heart?Dialogue: 50,0:33:54.75,0:33:56.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 50,0:33:56.30,0:33:58.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When they're stricken with an incurable disease?Dialogue: 50,0:33:58.85,0:34:00.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 50,0:34:00.85,0:34:03.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When they eat a poisonous mushroom soup?Dialogue: 50,0:34:03.06,0:34:04.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:34:06.72,0:34:10.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A person dies... when they are forgotten.Dialogue: 50,0:34:12.20,0:34:15.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if I disappear, my dream will come true.Dialogue: 50,0:34:15.93,0:34:19.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The people's sickness of the heart will be cured as well.Dialogue: 50,0:34:20.41,0:34:23.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why're you crying... Dalton?Dialogue: 50,0:34:25.21,0:34:28.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering... if this country will be cured as well.Dialogue: 50,0:34:29.41,0:34:32.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course. If someone is willing to carry it forward.Dialogue: 50,0:34:32.09,0:34:35.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Dalton! What are you crying for?Dialogue: 50,0:34:38.86,0:34:45.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Soon a monster will arrive. He's my son. Don't hurt him.Dialogue: 50,0:34:47.90,0:34:55.03,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Chopper. Your mushroom can't kill me.Dialogue: 50,0:34:56.16,0:34:59.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a marvelous life it's been!Dialogue: 50,0:35:00.75,0:35:02.33,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, quack...Dialogue: 50,0:35:04.08,0:35:07.34,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:35:28.80,0:35:34.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He blew himself up! What a hippo!Dialogue: 50,0:35:41.18,0:35:41.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh!Dialogue: 50,0:35:41.70,0:35:42.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?!Dialogue: 50,0:35:42.66,0:35:43.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!Dialogue: 50,0:35:43.66,0:35:44.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shoot it!Dialogue: 50,0:35:44.60,0:35:46.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh!Dialogue: 50,0:35:46.08,0:35:48.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:35:51.99,0:35:55.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave. Get out of here!Dialogue: 50,0:35:55.86,0:35:58.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you possibly defeat them...Dialogue: 50,0:35:58.56,0:36:01.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when you can't even beat me!Dialogue: 50,0:36:02.43,0:36:05.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I apologize on behalf of all those who laughed at Hiriluk's death!Dialogue: 50,0:36:08.60,0:36:11.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Without enough power, you'll just die in vain.Dialogue: 50,0:36:13.57,0:36:19.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This country has seen enough sacrifices for one day.Dialogue: 50,0:36:20.11,0:36:21.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 50,0:36:21.58,0:36:22.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:36:27.45,0:36:28.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You let him flee, Dalton.Dialogue: 50,0:36:28.75,0:36:31.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You still don't get it?Dialogue: 50,0:36:31.85,0:36:36.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only man who tried to save this sick country has just died.Dialogue: 50,0:36:36.46,0:36:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When everyone gave up and despaired,Dialogue: 50,0:36:38.46,0:36:41.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a kind doctor died trying to save this country!Dialogue: 50,0:36:41.20,0:36:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what if someone like that dies?Dialogue: 50,0:36:44.27,0:36:48.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see now where the kingdom is headed, and it's best if it dies too.Dialogue: 50,0:36:48.27,0:36:51.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With us at the helm, it can't be rebuilt.Dialogue: 50,0:36:51.77,0:36:53.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if medical care progresses...Dialogue: 50,0:36:53.51,0:36:55.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even if medical research continues...Dialogue: 50,0:36:57.05,0:36:59.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,no amount of medicine can cure a fool!Dialogue: 50,0:37:00.75,0:37:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I let you speak your mind... and it's made me extremely angry!Dialogue: 50,0:37:10.19,0:37:14.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please... please teach me to be a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:37:14.17,0:37:19.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please... teach me to be a doctor! I'll become the cure-all!Dialogue: 50,0:37:19.87,0:37:24.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll become a doctor who can cure anything. I'll even cure a country!Dialogue: 50,0:37:24.87,0:37:26.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because... Because...Dialogue: 50,0:37:26.68,0:37:31.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's no disease that can't be cured!Dialogue: 50,0:37:37.72,0:37:41.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can call me... Doctorine.Dialogue: 50,0:37:45.93,0:37:49.83,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't... die here.Dialogue: 50,0:37:49.83,0:37:53.00,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I will carry on his will.Dialogue: 50,0:37:56.84,0:38:02.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So for the last six years... Tony-kun has been studying under you.Dialogue: 50,0:38:02.11,0:38:08.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I taught him everything I know.Dialogue: 50,0:38:08.25,0:38:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine! Doctorine!Dialogue: 50,0:38:11.63,0:38:13.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine! There's a problem!Dialogue: 50,0:38:13.98,0:38:15.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol is back!Dialogue: 50,0:38:18.09,0:38:19.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that so...Dialogue: 50,0:38:19.36,0:38:21.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! That bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:38:22.66,0:38:24.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's that big mouth!Dialogue: 50,0:38:28.97,0:38:31.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look! Everything is just how I left it!Dialogue: 50,0:38:31.54,0:38:34.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to my castle and restore the Kingdom of Drum!Dialogue: 50,0:38:37.41,0:38:40.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just a moment, King Wapol! On top of the castle...Dialogue: 50,0:38:40.55,0:38:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:38:46.35,0:38:48.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that strange flag?Dialogue: 50,0:38:48.89,0:38:51.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened to Drum's royal flag?!Dialogue: 50,0:38:55.13,0:38:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I burned that thing.Dialogue: 50,0:38:57.95,0:39:02.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you show yourself, Dr. Kureha! The last survivor of the doctor hunt!Dialogue: 50,0:39:02.14,0:39:04.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This castle is no longer yours!Dialogue: 50,0:39:04.71,0:39:08.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't a place for rotten brats like you!Dialogue: 50,0:39:08.62,0:39:13.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave this country! The Kingdom of Drum has already died out!Dialogue: 50,0:39:14.18,0:39:16.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 50,0:39:17.71,0:39:18.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:39:20.71,0:39:23.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat the crap outta him!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:49.92,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Quack DoctorDialogue: 1,0:03:44.95,0:03:49.92,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Quack DoctorDialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:40.22,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Hiriluk, Quack DoctorDialogue: 1,0:04:35.76,0:04:40.22,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Hiriluk, Quack DoctorDialogue: 2,0:04:35.76,0:04:40.22,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Hiriluk, Quack DoctorDialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:55.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha (133 Years Old)Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.46,0:05:55.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha (133 Years Old)Dialogue: 2,0:05:51.46,0:05:55.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha (133 Years Old)Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:17.66,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,One Year LaterDialogue: 1,0:16:13.74,0:16:17.66,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,One Year LaterDialogue: 0,0:24:02.34,0:24:04.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,One Week LaterDialogue: 1,0:24:02.34,0:24:04.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,One Week LaterDialogue: 0,0:25:34.85,0:25:37.52,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol DrumDialogue: 1,0:25:34.85,0:25:37.52,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol DrumDialogue: 0,0:25:37.56,0:25:42.23,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Chess Drum CouncilorDialogue: 1,0:25:37.56,0:25:42.23,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Chess Drum CouncilorDialogue: 2,0:25:37.56,0:25:42.23,Captions-207-,,